// secure trading system //

// a handful of client commands were added for trade
// trade_help - displays short in-client help
// trade  - makes a trade request or begins a trade request
// trade_end - closes the current active trade without exchanging goods
// trade_accept  - accepts the current trade terms. if trade is being finalized, a confirm code is required
// trade_unaccept - undoes previous acceptance of trade terms
// trade_bits  - sets the bit amount for your side of the trade
// trade_add  - adds an upgrade from sys.upgrades to your trade offers
// trade_rem  - removes an upgrade from your offers
// trade_up_info  - displays detailed information about an upgrade offered for trade
// trade_fee  - sets which user in the trade pays the fee

// misc //

// notification of 60 day account expiration. log into the forums ( https://hackmud.com/forums ), provide your email and have the notify me checkbox checked. all existing accounts with an email on it will get email notifications
// /auto  - autorun client command can control the minimum time between autorunning now

